/><br/>The most likely supposition goes something like this ... Some Bronze Age sailors were travelling through the English Channel when their boat got a hole in its side. Perhaps it hit a rock or was starting to rot. It began to take on water.", "id": 2}, {"time": "62000", "image": "engenn9le05ob07re2img03.jpg", "text": "To stop the leak one of the sailors took off his leather underwear and used it to plug the hole.  Leather swells when it's wet and therefore makes a perfect stopper. Because water was no longer flowing into the boat, they were able to continue on to their destination. <br/><br/>The leather garment succeeded in sealing the hole in the side of the boat until it was found last year.<br/>Who could imagine having leather underwear, let alone that it could be so useful?", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "engenn9le05ob07re6img01.jpg"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "engenn9le05ob07re6img02.jpg"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 3, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "engenn9le05ob07re6img03.jpg"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 4, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "engenn9le05ob07re6img04.jpg"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 5, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}